+# unbuildable in Helium's pruned tree (chrome/test/data is stripped), so the
+# pure-logic pieces get their own minimal gtest binary.
+# helium-fork: the sidebar's model layer, tested on its own. The official
+# unit_tests target cannot be built here -- Helium's pruning removes
+# chrome/test/data/extensions/..., which unit_tests.inputdeps needs -- so
+# anything that wants coverage has to be reachable from a target this small.
